<p data-structure="Precedent" id="p_135"><span class="citetext" data-sentiment="Pos" data-docid="55216283" id="span_66">62.    This Court in <a href="/doc/55216283/" id="a_186">Uttar Pradesh Power Corporation Limited and Others v.
