</blockquote><p data-structure="Section" id="p_136">63.   Thus, reliance on <a href="/doc/83044125/" id="a_192">Regulation 153(15)</a> of the Code 2014 framed under
<a href="/doc/95809628/" id="a_193">Section 50</a> of the Act 2003 by the respondent (consumers) is thoroughly
